  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Performance sphere ((dance) package), associated ranks 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a single (dance) talent that you possess—you gain the benefits of the chosen (dance) talent as a constant effect, treating your dance area as being your threatened area if the talent relies on it.</p>\n<p>Due to not being an actual use of this ability, it does not need to be maintained (nor does it receive benefits for being maintained), and only affects you and therefore cannot gain dancers. If you are dancing, you can choose to add the chosen (dance) talent to the dance without it counting towards the total number of (dance) talents you could apply to it.</p>\n<p>You can spend 1 hour to change the chosen (dance) talent to a different talent that you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
